flowchart TD
 D[Versioned golden dataset] --> R[Agent runner + fixed config]
 R --> T[Capture full trajectory]
 T --> Q[Deterministic quality evaluators]
 T --> S[Safety and policy evaluators]
 Q --> M[Metric aggregator]
 S --> H{Hard gates pass?}
 M --> H
 H -->|No| X[Reject candidate + failure report]
 H -->|Yes| B[Compare baseline, p50/p95 and cost]
 B --> C{Release thresholds pass?}
 C -->|No| W[Investigate regression]
 C -->|Yes| K[Canary + monitor + rollback guard]
